OL,3,ATaylor Swift dominated the VMAs, but do
OL,4,Amusic videos still matter?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe're far from the days of blockbuster
OL,7,Fmusic videos playing back-to-back on TV
OL,8,Fchannels like MTV.
OL,10,FCatchy hooks and sleek dance routines
OL,11,Fnow dominate social media feeds, each
OL,12,Fhoping to stop people in their tracks
OL,13,Flong enough for them to give a new song
OL,14,Fa chance.
OL,16,FThe evolution of this landscape was
OL,17,Fcemented last year when MTV axed five
OL,18,Fmusic channels in the UK after almost
OL,19,F40 years of rolling footage.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
